@startuml
!include style.iuml
|Content Administrator (author)|
start
repeat
  :Edit the catalogue file: food, names,\nnutrition values, portions, recipe;
  :Submit the change for review;
  |Zindeo Catalogue Pipeline|
  :Validate automatically: required nutrients\npresent, energy within 15% of the\nenergy from macronutrients;
  |Content Administrator (reviewer)|
  :If valid, review sources, portions\nand values; approve or request changes;
  |Zindeo Catalogue Pipeline|
repeat while (Valid and approved?) is (no: author\ncorrects the change) not (yes)
:Load the change into the database;
:Mark the food as verified;
:The food becomes visible in\nsearch and recognition;
stop
@enduml
